  "description": "Built from the material that bicycle dreams are made of, the Mache-Ti is the gravel bike in its most perfect form. The titanium frame reflects the light with a matt sheen, and every bike enthusiast will be enchanted. In addition to its magnificent appearance, the Mache-Ti offers all the advantages of the precious material titanium: robust, comfortable, corrosion-resistant and light - the best prerequisites for sporty rides and, of course, bikepacking tours. The frame and fork - also made of titanium - have a large number of mounting points for attaching bags and accessories of all kinds. As cables and wires would be a sin on this frame, the Mache-Ti is equipped with the SRAM Force XPLR AXS wireless drivetrain - and XPLR 10-44 cassette with a wide range for demanding routes.",
